Dashboard Mockup






Dashboard consists of 3 tabs and defined as follows:

Tab Name
Description
Read Me
Contains the glossary of terms, KPI definitions, and an explanation of the tracking methodology (Baseline vs. Current vs. Goal) to ensure standardized use across all sites.
How To
Provides step-by-step instructions for Action Item Owners on how to submit new actions via the Google Form, update existing progress, and troubleshoot common data-entry errors.
Summary
The Executive Dashboard layer contains real-time visual summaries. It displays the Portfolio Overview (Active, On Track, At Risk), the Site Snapshot matrix, Top Exceptions, and the Gantt Timeline.
Raw Data
The hidden backend database tabs (Action_Master, Update_Log, Submission_Log) where the Google Apps Script ingests form entries, records timestamps, and executes automated status calculations.



